> >>>> The same behavior is visible on a Dell OptiPlex 7010. The longer times
> >>>> seem to happen, when the module *e1000e* is probed during the same time.
> >>>>
> >>>> Signed-off-by: Paul Menzel <pmenzel@molgen.mpg.de>
